AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001707> "define the boundaries of this cavity for a variety of species and check that parthood relations are not too strong.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#source> "Wikipedia:Nasal_cavity") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000001> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001707> "a large air filled space above and behind the nose in the middle of the face[WP][Wikipedia:Nasal_cavity].")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#source> "HP") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000008> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001707> "in humans, the cavity includes and starts at the nares and reaches all the way through to the and includes the choanae, the posterior nasal apertures")
